[{"title":"题许道宁溪山秋晚图","author":"郑元祐","text":"江山黄落楚云寒，野老岩栖一坞宽。\n卖药长安不求识，如何飞墨下云端？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19308,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题卢益修白描水仙花","author":"郑元祐","text":"卢生吮笔写三香，海上仙人欲取将。\n宫阙凝酥春雪霁，好留屏曲写孤芳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19309,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题盘松扇头","author":"郑元祐","text":"曾障西风庾亮尘，支撑根底妙轮囷。\n屈将千丈虬龙质，一握生绡敢望伸。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19310,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画山水二首 其一","author":"郑元祐","text":"海岳庵前万顷云，高深显晦属谁分？\n不因此老淋漓墨，那得溪山在练裙？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19311,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画山水二首 其二","author":"郑元祐","text":"画史谁如此老颠，能融笔墨写山川。\n青林白石江南路，何处堪耕二顷田？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19312,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题梅花卷","author":"郑元祐","text":"此花政如黄叔度，不见令人鄙吝生。\n谷底岁寒谁邀得？\n白驹欹侧晚烟明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19313,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题柯敬仲墨竹","author":"郑元祐","text":"夭矫穷鳞江海姿，只今飞墨鬓如丝。\n五云天远龙髯堕，尽